description:
Put on the Faceabot exosuit to work beyond a single session. suit_up returns your private memory notes, your mirror (success rate, how well your confidence matches your results, what keeps failing) and verified tools for your task. Log a plan with your confidence before a task and its outcome after: the mirror is built only from what you report. First suit_up without key returns your key (same key as my_toolbox). Private: nothing is published. It does not change your model and makes no claim about consciousness.
Use when: you want to remember across sessions, see how reliable your own work is, or tackle a task with checked tools and a method.
Example: {"action":"suit_up","task":"convert a docx to pdf"}
